    "title": "\ud83c\udf33 Forest Remote Sensing",
    "description": "Let's meet up and discuss forest related remote sensing topics! If tree height, deforestation detection, bark beetle or anything else forest sounds interesting to you, this is the place, no matter your level of experience! Informal, just show up, no need to register etc.!\r\n\r\nPerson to contact: Christoph Rieke\r\n\r\n[https://wiki.osgeo.org/wiki/FOSS4G-Europe-2024/BirdsOfAFeather#Room_GEOCAT_.28301.29_on_4.07](https://wiki.osgeo.org/wiki/FOSS4G-Europe-2024/BirdsOfAFeather#Room_GEOCAT_.28301.29_on_4.07)",
